  { number := 235, text := "1. Numbered markdown is the contract humans read; the specification is also encoded in Lean; proofs live in separate Lean modules; Formal Vibefication citations keep the canonical Proof of Keags URLs; `spec_check` remains form and is not meaning (Clause 4.1)." },
  { number := 236, text := "2. A `.sstt` file uses magic `SSTECHTREE01`, `CompactSize` counts, node records, and directed edge records as in Clause 4.2; a Surmount product writer is not claimed shipped; this Lake package includes a Lean writer (Clause 4.2)." },
  { number := 237, text := "3. Lengths and counts use canonical `CompactSize` shortest form; golden vectors match; this Lake package restates the laws and proves small encode then decode cases; full `UInt64` proof remains in `btc-verified` (Clause 4.3)." },
