  { number := 290, text := "" },
  { number := 291, text := "First publication of Surmount Systems Tech Tree as numbered specification 0011 with file name `0011_Surmount_Systems_Tech_Tree.md`. Records that this document is the human contract for a graph of relationships among numbered specifications, sibling Lean encodings, materials under `ref/`, `SOURCE.md`, skills, and other cited files, with no directed cycle, for lookup in the style of a `memex`. Specifies the `.sstt` binary format with magic `SSTECHTREE01`, `CompactSize` counts, nodes, and directed edges. Requires the encoded graph to be a graph with no directed cycle. Records that markdown citation among numbered specifications MAY cycle and is not that encoded graph. Restates Bitcoin canonical `CompactSize` and golden vectors; full `UInt64` proof remains in `btc-verified` and is pinned as Form 1 at `ref/btc-verified`. Requires markdown path links in this repository to resolve, checked by `repo_links_check`. Records that a Surmount product writer is not shipped and that this Lake package includes a Lean writer. Records Formal Vibefication with canonical Proof of Keags URLs and back linking. Requires residual honesty that beastdb, SSSSS, Slake, and Continuous Integration are ongoing and not ready for use." },
